# Conventions: p1 = first seat, p2 = second seat, both scripted; see interaction-tests/README.md.

=== quarry-sac-creature-pays-red
title: Lazotep Quarry tapped with a sacrificed creature adds one mana of any color, so Goblin Bombardment ({1}{R}) is castable with Plains + Quarry (differential-testing finding)
ref: Lazotep Quarry Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Plains;Lazotep Quarry;Ocelot Pride
  humanhand=Goblin Bombardment
script:
  p1: cast Goblin Bombardment
expect:
  controls p1 "Goblin Bombardment"
